    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "When a player item is created, its [`status`](avplayeritem/status-swift.property.md) is [`AVPlayerItem.Status.unknown`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum/unknown.md), meaning its media hasn’t been loaded and has not yet been enqueued for playback.",
      "ko": "플레이어 항목이 생성되면 [`status`](avplayeritem/status-swift.property.md)는 [`AVPlayerItem.Status.unknown`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum/unknown.md)입니다. 즉, 미디어가 아직 로드되지 않았고 재생을 위해 아직 큐에 추가되지 않았음을 의미합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a1c0666c7a120acbb3e70d02e97b935f7fd0789c9b019338394eee34a716281d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Associating a player item with an [`AVPlayer`](avplayer.md) immediately begins enqueuing the item’s media and preparing it for playback.",
      "ko": "플레이어 항목을 [`AVPlayer`](avplayer.md)와 연결하면 항목의 미디어를 즉시 큐에 넣고 재생 준비를 시작합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9a5704d49ae1bf20eb067201cb4ba5110a70b83d86fffd0404c124644d186452",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "When the player item’s media has been loaded and is ready for use, its status will change to [`AVPlayerItem.Status.readyToPlay`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum/readytoplay.md).",
      "ko": "플레이어 항목의 미디어가 로드되어 사용 준비가 되면 상태가 [`AVPlayerItem.Status.readyToPlay`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum/readytoplay.md)로 변경됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8222b91a570c592e8a895a46588f09cb0e860ae766112fb21f0cbeb0720cbdde",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0004",
      "source": "You can observe this change using key-value observing.",
      "ko": "이 변경은 key-value observing을 사용해 관찰할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "12d0808c41d3302f8c5fc3ecbd8f454ca1d6584e4cc8c8086e39686fbaafa50a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "For possible values, see [`AVPlayerItem.Status`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum.md).",
      "ko": "가능한 값은 [`AVPlayerItem.Status`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum.md)에서 확인하세요.",
      "sourceHash": "aba91cd06c78869fb0ddbed28501d9a550ca38f41f62e6bc4b8fc267e7c4a933",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
